# Every text file keeps LF on every checkout, on Windows too (a Windows
# checkout turns text into CRLF otherwise).
# - Tests read sources as text and match lines ending in \n: the interface
#   tests read Rust files and the catalog, and update.rs embeds two scripts
#   with include_str!.
# - The shell scripts are run inside WSL from the Windows checkout
#   (app/scripts/stage-engine-windows.sh). A CRLF script does not run there.
* text=auto eol=lf
